    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d145">

                <pb facs="0252" n="148" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg148"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1259.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-01-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 27, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The French Minister has received instructions revoking his former instructions.
                    All group representatives have signed a letter to the Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs on the question of advances, adopting to some extent amendments to
                    contract.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Calhoun</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
